# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Cloudflare applies a matching rule even when a real file exists at the
# source path (every rule behaves like Netlify's force=true), so keep rules
# explicit and never add blanket wildcards over real pages.

# The Map & App page was retired on 2026-09-15; the map section on the homepage replaces it.
/app.html /#app 301
/de/app.html /de/#app 301
/fr/app.html /fr/#app 301
